{% extends '_layouts/base.twig' %}

{% block hero %}
<section class="w-full relative h-80 md:h-96 lg:h-[32rem] overflow-visible mb-8">
    <img src="/assets/images/amish_wood.jpg" alt="Old Amish Barn" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" loading="eager" />
    {% include '_partials/_nav.twig' %}
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-center">
        <h1 class="text-white text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold drop-shadow-lg text-center">About Us</h1>
    </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 mb-16 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Handcrafted Excellence Since Day One</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            At Jeff's Amish Furniture, we bring you authentic, handcrafted furniture built by skilled Amish artisans using time-honored traditions passed down through generations. Every piece is meticulously crafted from premium solid hardwoods, ensuring furniture that's not just beautiful, but built to last a lifetime.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 mt-10">The Amish Difference</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Amish craftsmanship represents an unwavering commitment to quality. Each joint is carefully fitted, each surface hand-finished, and each detail thoughtfully considered. No particle board, no shortcuts—just solid wood construction that stands the test of time. This dedication to excellence means your furniture will be treasured for generations.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 mt-10">Our Products</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            From dining room tables and bedroom sets to custom cabinets and office furniture, we offer a wide selection of handcrafted pieces. Whether you need a single statement piece or furnishings for your entire home, we work with you to create furniture that matches your style and meets your needs.
        </p>
        
        <div class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-700 p-6 my-10">
            <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Ready to Explore Your Options?</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-4">
                Every home is unique, and so are your furniture needs. Whether you're looking for a specific piece or want to discuss custom options, we're here to help.
            </p>
            <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-amber-700 hover:bg-amber-800 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg transition shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl">
                Contact Us Today
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
